This directory holds a BUILT drop of Lector, vendored into Paddock's Studio:
compiled bundles, type declarations and, for the wasm packages, the wasm
binary. It is not the upstream source tree. Lector is developed by
The Intelligence Company AB (publ) in its own repository.
